01:55:59.567 --> 01:56:01.900
ANDREW HUBERMAN: It's almost
like a principle of nature.

01:56:01.900 --> 01:56:02.660
ANDY GALPIN: 100%.

01:56:02.660 --> 01:56:03.160
Yeah.

01:56:03.160 --> 01:56:07.180
So with the women, I really
want to see the women--

01:56:07.180 --> 01:56:09.070
if I want to see men
above 55, I really

01:56:09.070 --> 01:56:11.562
want to see women
above 50 as the target.

01:56:11.562 --> 01:56:13.520
And if you like, you're
